WEBVTT

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:17.160
I've been waiting for you.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.160
Sigui!

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.870
Annelotte, the sinful heretic.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.670
Nee-sama!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:28.790
Aneja!

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.460
Lunaluna!

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:32.130
Tarnyang!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.050
Sainyang!

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:38.140
I shall judge you in the name of the Lord.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:45.520
I was born crying alone.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:51.030
In a horizon of light and darkness.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:56.360
Why not obtain these bonds.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:04.710
They were shining in my hands just now.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:17.590
The melancholy of one in sever billion.

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:22.930
Someday the end of the world will come.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:28.310
So what? I'll have no regret.

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:36.740
Say, yeah!! Stop running straight after that falling star.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:41.530
Let your worries fade away!!

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:46.830
This blue Earth is nestled in the sky.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:52.170
Like I always envisioned Elysium.

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:57.510
I will shape my own past and future.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:02.890
I will look up to the eternal Stellar.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:08.310
I can hear the song of life.

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:16.780
W-What?!

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:22.660
She went to Gainos Castle to save some friends?

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.340
Nee-sama!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:40.930
Aneja!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.760
We're finally out of danger.

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:27.640
Our new way of using force fields succeeded, Vante.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:35.650
That's not good! I'm sure that's Onii-chan!

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.110
We need to get over there now!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.840
Nee-sama, pull yourself together!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.300
Aneja, don't lose!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:03:59.760
Nee-sama, will win.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.010
Of course she will!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:02.590
Nee-san...

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.270
I don't understand.

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:11.390
Why is this heretic,

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:13.940
who goes against the Lord and disturbs the peace,

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.610
so loved and so strong?

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.190
This is sad.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.030
Ymir-sama?!

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:28.030
Annelotte. Your friends lives rest in my hands.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.200
Sigui-dono, go right ahead.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.410
Finish her off.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:33.370
But...

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.790
Nee-nee!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:35.920
You coward!

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.290
A dramatic turn of events?

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.220
How moe...

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.970
I can't hear any fighting anymore.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.220
Hurry up, you guys!

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.400
Young'uns really do recover faster.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.650
And I was just carrying her on my back...

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.820
Please stop, Ymir-sama!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.610
What you're doing goes against God's will.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:08.030
I wish to fight fairly with Annelotte—

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:12.160
That's an awfully odd thing for an Inquisitor to say.

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:14.910
Nee-nee, we're fine!

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.120
I'd die for you, Aneja!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:19.590
I don't want to die!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.420
Annelotte, throw down your weapon.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.550
My butt!

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:28.470
There we go!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:47.780
Onee-sama!

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:49.200
Mirim!

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.620
We're finally here.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.330
Ymir-sama?

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.830
Want to dance some more?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.500
Lunaluna-san!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:04.300
So the fake ran herself all the way over here, eh?

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.010
They're your friends?

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:07.670
Yes...

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.100
Just kidding!

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:19.980
What is she?

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.320
I won't let you get away!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.690
You're not getting away!

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:35.830
This is the work of a monster...

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.040
We can't...

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.540
...move again.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.610
Who are you?!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.780
I'm Melona!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.530
What were you doing in this castle?!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.210
Since it went so well, I'll tell you.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:22.710
I'm working for the Swamp Witch bringing

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:25.590
death, corruption, and depravity to the continent,

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.210
just as she asked.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:28.710
The Swamp Witch?

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.130
The one who rules this continent, who brings with her a host

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:35.180
of monsters and zombies from the underworld!

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:38.270
And the Witch has regained her true body

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.100
and been completely resurrected.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:44.650
The Witch has summoned several monsters, just like me,

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:48.150
and have planted seeds of strife throughout the continent.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:51.070
As a result, the land is covered with barren soil.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.660
Gainos is about the only place that still has life to it.

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.240
The noble's rebellion and the expansion of the swamps...

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.450
It was all as planned!

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.290
But, you see...

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:06.340
The beautiful warriors always get in our way.

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:08.550
So we got rid of them by cursing them,

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.380
issuing bounties... The works.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:19.970
In particular, the amplification curse we cast on

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.480
the Queen seems to have worked exceptionally.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:25.600
She's doing exactly what the Witch wants!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:31.650
And every last one of you here today will be exterminated.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.490
Now, Queen, I leave the rest to you.

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:14.610
The Queen wasn't being controlled?

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.740
We're finally free!

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.530
I'm tired...

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:23.200
My Queen. You knew she was a monster?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.160
What a pointless story.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.960
It is I, Claudette, who will rule over the continent.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.840
The victory I seized through force is justice itself.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.260
The strong shall rule over the weak,

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.630
and bring forth order and stability.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:41.680
My reign shall lead this continent into prosperity.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.560
And if there is anyone who gets in my way,

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:48.100
be it God Himself, I shall destroy them.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.020
Some mere witch or rebel won't stop me.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.730
That's wrong! People have hearts.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.900
You cannot control them with power alone.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:59.950
Your methods will only bring sorrow to the people!

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.160
Sorrow?

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.540
Sorrow is a standard emotion for a person.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.620
If you don't wish to feel sorrow, then become stronger.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.250
I cannot agree with what you're saying, either.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.250
Humans are weak,

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:15.300
and are always seeking salvation from the Lord.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:19.680
But you're stating that God is unneeded.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.100
That statement is on the same level as burning someone alive.

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:28.350
If you don't agree, then force me to surrender.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.520
Who's going first?

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.070
Listen up. We'll all fight her together,

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.320
and when she gets tired out, we'll beat the crap out of her.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.940
That's kind of a pathetic plan...

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:41.240
What's wrong? Will you not fight?

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:42.490
I will!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:43.910
I will go!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.750
I'm going, too!

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.960
Maximum output!

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:53.340
Mirim, no fair!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.840
Prepare yourself!

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:11.520
Onee-sama!

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.520
Nee-nee!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:19.530
Mirim!

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:20.950
Lunaluna!

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:25.910
No way...

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.130
Looks like I made it just in time.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.020
Yuit!

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.900
Isn't that an automaton? The alchemical miracle?

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:56.770
Huh?

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.190
How dare you, Ymir!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:05.120
W-Wait.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.580
It's not as simple as we thought.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:12.750
I will not allow a world that ignores the teachings of God!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.550
I am righteousness itself.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:23.050
May God place his judgment upon you.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.190
Go on ahead.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.480
I'll head back after I take a look at what's going on above.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.040
Prepare yourself!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:11.010
No way...

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.310
I will fight you all at once.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:39.920
What is that...

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.250
It's the same as before...

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:44.590
Sainyang!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:47.930
Sainyang! Tarnyang!

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:51.010
When you run ahead like that, you end up choking me!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.020
Ward!

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.450
What's happening here?

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:00.290
Hey! Laila!

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.960
Over here!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.130
What's going on?

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.510
It's just like it looks...

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:13.090
I guess you could say that the Queen's Blade is starting back up.

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.760
You're alive?

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.100
This is the only bit of body that I had left, though.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:23.360
This is no fun. It's too one-sided.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:26.980
That's because you amplified her strength, as well.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.370
Vante...

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:35.450
Onii-chan!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:53.470
Why do all of them try to help each other out so much?

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.230
Neither of them are breathing...

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:09.320
What?

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.150
Move out of the way!

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:21.870
Holy Pose: Healing.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.360
Watch out, Sigui!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.140
Onii-chan!

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.090
Onii-chan...

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.010
Looks like it's over.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.260
What should I do...

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:04.310
I can't report this to Nanael-sama.

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:20.370
You're finished.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.390
Maria-dono.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.560
You've done well, Annelotte.

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:49.560
All of you.

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:52.400
You're...

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:56.360
You must not kill these girls.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:24.180
Huh? She fell asleep!

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:28.470
A curse?

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:31.520
But... no matter who they may be...

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.990
I won't...

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:50.210
...let anyone else die.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:07.970
Leave.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.390
Take her and be gone.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.850
Hey, what kind of ending is that?

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.350
I guess the winner gets to do what she likes.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.770
Anyway, you there...

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.190
Looks like you need to pay attention.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:05.450
W-What's going on?

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:10.240
I did it!

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:14.160
Here's your report.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:22.260
I now know what I must do.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.840
What you have to do?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:27.930
I'm still not strong enough of a warrior.

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:34.430
Each one of us needs to become stronger.

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:38.020
We'll each encourage each other,

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:40.150
and then, if that brings us closer together,

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.110
I'm sure we'll be able to change the world.

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:48.820
My little sisters! When the three moons overlap,

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:50.330
let us meet again.

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:53.750
At that time we shall combine our forces,

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.620
and defeat the Thundercloud Queen.

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:57.540
I swear it upon this sword.

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:23.730
Those who protect,

00:22:23.730 --> 00:22:25.440
those who have been entrusted with something,

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:26.900
and those who pray...

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:31.240
When united under a just light,

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:34.740
a great power will illuminate the future.

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:28.550
People must continue to fight for their fate.

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:32.590
Unless they fight for the future they wish for,

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:37.270
they will never know whether or not they can attain it.
